{"id":"665258","name":"红椒猪舌头炒西芹","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"https://i8.meishichina.com/atta/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448471521464404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p800","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"熟猪舌头","amount":"122克"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"102克"},{"name":"西芹","amount":"276克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：熟猪舌头、红椒（已清洗）、西芹。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448580467170404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"将西芹抽去筋清洗清洗捞出。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448663091221404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在案板上斜切成块。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448684747720404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"将红椒放在案板上切成块。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448708220398404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"将熟猪舌头放在案板上切成片。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448731073396404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"将切好的西芹和红椒下入沸水锅中焯上1到2分钟后捞出。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448782980198404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入焯好的西芹和红椒翻炒翻炒。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448864692421404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"接着，合入切好的熟猪舌头翻炒翻炒。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448829394598404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后，加适量的盐。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/20250806175444891688773404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448955890288404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"调味炒匀即成。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/08/06/202508061754448975355963404188.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}